# Title:

Create and manage groups, including MS365 using Azure portal

# Purpose:
Create Ms365 group using Azure portal 

# Prerequisites:
- Microsoft 365 Business Basic (Licence)
- Group Administrator (Role)

# Procedure:

**STEP 1: OPEN AZURE ADMIN PORTAL**

1. Sign in to [Azure Portal]( https://portal.azure,com)
2. On the left-hand-side top corner click on the menue button and go down to Microsoft Entra ID.

**STEP 2: CREATE GROUP**

1. Click on the Group label
2. Click on New Group to create a new group
3. Select the type on group (Security or MS365), enter the name of the group and description of the group  
